MEDIA ASSETS

The upstream Fish Folk media assets — Copyright (c) 2020-2024 The Fish Folk Game
& Spicy Lobster Developers, licensed [CC BY-NC](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/)
— are NOT present in this fork. The NonCommercial term made them unusable in a
commercial product, so every image and sound was replaced.

All media in this fork is now either:

* CC0 1.0 (public domain), or
* generated by the scripts in tools/reskin/ and owned by the GameNight project.

Per-asset provenance is recorded in tools/reskin/ASSET-SOURCES.md.

The two bundled fonts (assets/ui/FairfaxSM.ttf, assets/ui/ark-pixel-16px-latin.ttf)
are unchanged and remain under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, which permits
commercial bundling.
